    <item>
      <title>在谈论更换政党时，费特曼发誓“永远不会”</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/amid-talk-of-a-party-switch-fetterman-vows-never.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[改变一个人的隶属关系在参议院很少见，但它可能会产生重大后果。宾夕法尼亚州的约翰·费特曼表示，他将继续担任民主党人。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/amid-talk-of-a-party-switch-fetterman-vows-never.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 01:41:44 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普对法官谴责国税局的裁决提出上诉诉讼作为自我交易的练习</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/trump-appeal-irs-lawsuit-ruling.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[这是总统正在加倍努力争取一项给他带来巨大利益的协议的各个方面的最新迹象，尽管这些协议危及了他对司法部长人选的确认。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/trump-appeal-irs-lawsuit-ruling.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 23:47:53 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普放弃让乌克兰制造爱国者导弹的协议</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/trump-ukraine-patriot-missiles.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[乌克兰总统警告说，该国的爱国者拦截弹即将耗尽，而爱国者拦截弹是该国击落俄罗斯弹道导弹的最可靠武器。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/trump-ukraine-patriot-missiles.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 23:31:50 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
