    <item>
      <title>托德·布兰奇对特朗普的忠诚使他的司法部长确认面临风险</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/todd-blanche-ag-trump-immunity.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[托德·布兰奇的做法与参议院由两人组成的陪审团现实相冲突，迄今为止，这种现实使他无法获得他梦寐以求的奖项：参议院确认所赋予的稳定和地位。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/todd-blanche-ag-trump-immunity.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 21:02:54 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普政府计划通过放松管制来扭转领先地位</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/head-start-deregulation.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[白宫试图阻止为贫困儿童提供学前教育资金，但未能成功。相反，它将寻求取消健康、识字和刷牙方面的标准。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/head-start-deregulation.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 20:31:08 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>为什么米奇·麦康奈尔不放弃参议院席位</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/why-mitch-mcconnell-isnt-giving-up-his-senate-seat.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[民主党人要求肯塔基州共和党人辞职。其他长期缺阵的人则没有面临这样的呼吁，但时代正在发生变化。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/why-mitch-mcconnell-isnt-giving-up-his-senate-seat.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 20:23:41 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>尽管进行了初步调查，特朗普仍将网络攻击归咎于明尼苏达州，而不是伊朗</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/trump-minnesota-iran-cyberattack-walz.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[特朗普总统在没有证据的情况下声称明尼苏达州民主党政府是该州供水系统网络攻击的“幕后黑手”。调查人员认为伊朗可能对此负责。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/trump-minnesota-iran-cyberattack-walz.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 19:48:38 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
